1
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:44,270
I am exhausted. My new exercise class is so hard.

2
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:47,220
Your new exercise class?

3
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:55,790
Yeah. My new advanced exercise class.

4
00:00:55,790 --> 00:01:00,890
Why advanced?

5
00:01:00,890 --> 00:01:01,770
My instructor thought that

6
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:06,120
the beginner's class was too easy for me.

7
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:08,800
Too easy for you?

8
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:13,120
Don't laugh. In the beginner's class,

9
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:15,930
they give you a chance to rest between exercises.

10
00:01:15,930 --> 00:01:17,210
So?

11
00:01:17,210 --> 00:01:21,250
The advanced class is nonstop.

12
00:01:21,250 --> 00:01:23,890
I lift weights every morning for sixty minutes

13
00:01:23,890 --> 00:01:25,700
without stopping.

14
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:29,280
No problem.

15
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,310
Listen, Richard,

16
00:01:31,310 --> 00:01:35,210
doing aerobics for an hour is a lot different than lifting weights.

17
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:37,250
Yeah. Quite a bit different.

18
00:01:37,250 --> 00:01:39,470
I think aerobics is easy.

19
00:01:39,470 --> 00:01:44,580
I could work out in your class with no problem.

20
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:45,800
You think so?

21
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:48,670
Oh, without a doubt.

22
00:01:48,670 --> 00:01:50,930
When's the next class?

23
00:01:50,930 --> 00:01:57,330
Tomorrow morning at ten o'clock. Try it.

24
00:01:57,330 --> 00:01:59,860
Tomorrow morning after lifting weights,

25
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,710
I'll try aerobics.

26
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:20,430
It's a nap. Tomorrow morning at ten o'clock.

27
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:23,280
Aren't you going to the aerobics class this morning?

28
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:32,660
Of Course. Easy. No sweat.

29
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:34,790
You are not going to be able to move

30
00:02:34,790 --> 00:02:36,960
after this and the aerobics class.

31
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,790
Are you kidding me?

32
00:02:38,790 --> 00:02:44,620
It's going to be a piece of cake.

33
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:48,030
You want to bet?

34
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:50,340
Yeah. What's the bet?

35
00:02:50,340 --> 00:02:54,080
I bet I can go one hour in your class this morning

36
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:58,130
and not feel a thing!

37
00:02:58,130 --> 00:03:06,240
The bet is -- I win, and you cook dinner for the entire family.

38
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:10,080
Or you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

39
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,140
It's a bet.

40
00:03:11,140 --> 00:03:15,430
Ok. Call my instructor, Jack Davis, right now.

41
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:19,080
His number is 555-8842.

42
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:21,130
The advanced class starts at ten o'clock.

43
00:03:21,130 --> 00:03:22,070
Well, it's eight twenty now.

44
00:03:22,070 --> 00:03:25,820
It only takes eight minutes by bicycle to the aerobics class.

45
00:03:25,820 --> 00:03:39,000
Give him a call.

46
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,210
Davis Aerobics Center for Good Health.

47
00:03:41,210 --> 00:03:42,250
Jack Davis, please.

48
00:03:42,250 --> 00:03:43,320
This is Jack Davis.

49
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:45,070
Hello. This is Richard Stewart.

50
00:03:45,070 --> 00:03:47,980
My wife, Marilyn Stewart, is a member of your program.

51
00:03:47,980 --> 00:03:49,150
I'd like to come to

52
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:51,590
the ten o'clock advanced class this morning.

53
00:03:51,590 --> 00:03:54,340
Oh, fine, fine. Be here a few minutes early.

54
00:03:54,340 --> 00:03:57,120
You need to complete some forms before the class.

55
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,210
Thanks. I'm on my way over.

56
00:03:59,210 --> 00:03:59,880
Good-bye.

57
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:09,300
Bye-bye. It's all set. I'm going.

58
00:04:09,300 --> 00:04:10,330
Bye.

59
00:04:10,330 --> 00:04:11,630
See you later.

60
00:04:11,630 --> 00:04:12,930
Good luck.

61
00:04:12,930 --> 00:04:15,680
Don't forget about the bet.

62
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,530
Dinner for the entire family.

63
00:04:17,530 --> 00:04:19,420
And that includes Susan.

64
00:04:19,420 --> 00:04:22,420
Don't you forget.
